{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致多雲　初時有一兩陣微雨\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261101-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶覆蓋該區。本港地區今日(11月1日)天氣預測，大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩偏東風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日部分時間有陽光。隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.862222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T23:22:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:18.718662+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:02.792980+00:00","content_hash":"d4af3c2afe0e57b8aaf3ba93902f3415dcec72443c9c43e371f5497287dc8aff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}